# Code style (condensed — full rules in [CODE_STYLE.md](CODE_STYLE.md))

**Migration stance:** new files follow this fully; existing files converge on structure (folders, CSS modules, export style) when substantially reworked. Formatting is uniform and Prettier-owned (4-space, single quotes, no semi, width 110 — `npm run format`); the generated `lib/knowledge/embeddedSimcData.ts`, `knowledge/`, and markdown are prettier-ignored.

- **Layout**: `pages/<route>.tsx` = thin orchestrators; `pages/api/` = HTTP adapters only; new UI unit with tests/styles/children → `components/<Area>/<ComponentName>/` (`ComponentName.tsx`, thin `index.tsx`, `styles.module.css`, colocated `__tests__/`); shared pure helpers → `lib/<concept>/`; single-owner helpers live next to their owner. Never `lib/utils.ts` or one-file folders.
- **Naming**: PascalCase domain phrases (no `List`/`Item`/`Wrapper`). Verb contract: `build*` assemble, `get*` sync read, `map*` shape transform only, `fetch*` real network I/O only, `handle*` internal handler, `on*` callback prop, `is*/has*/should*` booleans. Local object shapes = `I`-prefixed `interface`; exported props = `ComponentNameProps` `type`. Domain-explicit names (`reportCode`, `specId`) over `id`/`data`/`item`.
- **Components**: arrow-fn const + `export default` at bottom (not `export default function`). New components use CSS modules; do not grow `lib/styles.ts` inline maps or `globals.css` `pa-*` classes (legacy). Theme via CSS custom properties. Early return for empty, named booleans, `&&` for optional blocks; mapping/parsing in `.ts` files, not JSX; no nested ternaries in JSX, no `any`.
- **Tests**: colocated; top `describe` = exact export name; `it` titles lowercase present-tense sentences; `getByTestId` first with `data-testid="ComponentName"` (indexed `Row--${id}`); assert `aria-expanded`/`aria-hidden` for collapsibles; `jest.clearAllMocks()` in `beforeEach` when mocking.
- **API routes**: thin adapters — method check (405 otherwise), validate at the boundary only (400 `{ error }`), call a `lib/` domain function, map to status + JSON. Every non-2xx returns `{ error: string }`, no stack traces/secrets, upstream errors mapped not passed through. `process.env`/secrets/`fs` only in server-only modules (`lib/server*`) imported solely from `pages/api/**`.
- **Imports**: components default-export; helpers/types named; `import type` for types; direct relative paths, no single-consumer barrels. Comments explain why, not the next line.
